# The bytes of one /clear: a prompt with an answer, then /clear, then the
# wire -- which writes a synchronized update brackets, and where the
# linefeeds that carry the document into scrollback land among them.
gateway reset-turns.json
wait 2
type first question alpha
key Enter
wait 3
wire turn1
type /clear
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
snap clear
snapfull clear
wire clear
